# ============================================================================
# SECTION: QT4-DEBIAN-PACKAGES  (what qt4-extract/ was unpacked from)
# sha256 is of the .deb as served by archive.debian.org, verified by download.
# TSV: package  version  architecture  sha256  size_bytes  source_package  url
# ============================================================================
libqt4-dev	4:4.8.6+git64-g5dc8b2b+dfsg-3+deb8u1	armel	55bec20d00137291967fd0c2523aebf352ea3021e6d923ede67e71314d1396b8	890012	qt4-x11	http://archive.debian.org/debian/pool/main/q/qt4-x11/libqt4-dev_4.8.6+git64-g5dc8b2b+dfsg-3+deb8u1_armel.deb
libqtcore4	4:4.8.6+git64-g5dc8b2b+dfsg-3+deb8u1	armel	564e1854cdb10722ae9d180645180bca425bce2ec1d8ffd31a6f1ac1c8b706b9	1420836	qt4-x11	http://archive.debian.org/debian/pool/main/q/qt4-x11/libqtcore4_4.8.6+git64-g5dc8b2b+dfsg-3+deb8u1_armel.deb
libqtgui4	4:4.8.6+git64-g5dc8b2b+dfsg-3+deb8u1	armel	3b6102b008a5cbe434f2394791e81452b20bb349150d4e5dc8abd0ecf8fda28a	3613208	qt4-x11	http://archive.debian.org/debian/pool/main/q/qt4-x11/libqtgui4_4.8.6+git64-g5dc8b2b+dfsg-3+deb8u1_armel.deb
#
# ============================================================================
# SECTION: TREE-DIGESTS
# A whole-tree fingerprint for the parts too large to list file-by-file: sha256 over a
# C-sorted "<sha256|symlink target>\t<relpath>" listing of every entry. Independent of
# mtimes and traversal order, so it is stable across machines and re-extractions.
# TSV: tree  digest  contents
# ============================================================================
qt4-extract	b316ff7e0f98daea18e6ed90eb05458aa196e8212aab79866f7e982bb70051a4	2922 files, 28 symlinks
staging/lib	0412309eb02933960fd2becc203e69d1a58adf220fa24fbddcc603f2fd61ff0a	7 files, 10 symlinks
#
# ============================================================================
# SECTION: SUBMODULES  (public git, pinned by the parent repository's gitlinks)
# TSV: path  commit  describe  url
# ============================================================================
third_party/libpbnjson	c4b0611639324f36e69fbbd531b7fd6d2ca894e8	submissions/10	https://github.com/openwebos/libpbnjson
third_party/yajl	17b1790fb9c8abbb3c0f7e083864a6a014191d56	1.0.12	https://github.com/lloyd/yajl
third_party/npapi-headers	9d3512142291f0bbd75b014e49a552c1962a11d5	0.4	https://github.com/isis-project/npapi-headers
#
# VERSION SKEW, recorded because it is load-bearing and easy to "fix" wrongly:
#   pbnjson  headers submissions/10 (c4b0611)  vs  device library submission-38
#   yajl     submodule tag 1.0.12              vs  device library 1.0.7
#   Qt       headers 4.8.6 (Debian)            vs  device libraries 4.8.0 (HP)
# In each case the HEADERS are what this repo pins and the LIBRARY is whatever the device
# has. build-adapter-pdk.sh chose submissions/10 deliberately ("the device era") so gcc4
# instantiates what the device libpbnjson_cpp exports. Do not bump these to match each
# other without re-testing the adapter on hardware: the C++ ones are template/ABI-sensitive.
